    "detailed_description": "<strong>Game Overview</strong><br><br>- This game has very simple rules: you control a missile with a glowing sword attached to it and slash all the red balls in the stage.<br><br>- However, if the missile hits something, it will explode and the game will be over.<br><br>- Enjoy the thrilling game of getting as close as possible and hitting only with your sword.<br><br><br><strong>Game Contents</strong><br><br>- 10 stages in total<br><br>- After clearing the tutorial stage, you can return to the title screen to proceed to the stage selection screen.<br><br>- Xbox controller recommended, keyboard operation also supported<br><br><br><strong>Earning \u2605</strong><br><br>- Every stage has a time limit for earning \u2605.<br><br>- You can earn \u2605 by clearing it within the time limit.<br><br>- Collecting 10 \u2605 is the true clear.<br><br>- After earning, return to the title screen to become a gold rocket.",
